---
description: Enforce the official TDM Sass Module policy in all generated and edited UI styles.
globs:
  - "src/**/*.{ts,tsx,sass,scss,css}"
alwaysApply: true
---

# TDM Sass Module only

- Never create `.scss` or `.module.scss` files.
- Never migrate existing `.module.sass` files to SCSS.
- Component styles must use `.module.sass` with indented Sass syntax.
- Keep styles colocated with the owning component.
- Do not bypass this rule with broad global CSS.
- Complex CSS functions must compile under Dart Sass in indented syntax.
- Run `npm run check:tdm:sass-module-policy` before declaring work complete.
